context_info = ""
i = 0
for d in context:
    extraction = llm_query("You are given one document. Extract only if relevant to this composite query. Be concise.\n\nComposite query (the same person must satisfy all constraints):\n- Male immigrant to the United States between 1891 and 1899 (exclusive bounds of 1890 and 1900).\n- Returned to his home country to get married between 1916 and 1924.\n- Was a farmer and a hotelier in Washington state (USA).\n- A significant event in his life occurred at a wedding in a hotel between 1940 and 1944.\n- His name appeared on a historic list in Montana prior to 2023, even though his home was not in Montana.\n- A game belonging to his family was in a museum as of 2021.\n\nFrom the document, identify any candidate(s) who match all or part of the above. For each candidate found, provide:\n- Person: full name\n- Spouse: first name (if given)\n- Immigration year(s) evidence (quote)\n- Marriage/return-to-home-country timing evidence (quote)\n- Occupations and Washington location evidence (quote)\n- Wedding-in-hotel significant event 1940–1944 evidence (quote)\n- Historic list in Montana evidence (quote; name the list if possible)\n- Museum artifact (family game) evidence (quote; name the museum if possible)\nIf the document is irrelevant, answer: NONE\n\nBEGIN_DOCUMENT\n" + d + "\nEND_DOCUMENT")
    context_info = context_info + "DOC " + str(i) + " EXTRACT:\n" + extraction + "\n"
    i = i + 1

final_answer = llm_query("You will be given extractions from multiple documents. Your task: identify the single person who satisfies ALL of these constraints:\n- Immigrated to the U.S. between 1891 and 1899\n- Returned to home country to marry between 1916 and 1924\n- Was a farmer and a hotelier in Washington state\n- Had a significant event at a wedding in a hotel between 1940 and 1944\n- His name appeared on a historic list in Montana before 2023, though he did not live there\n- A game belonging to his family was in a museum as of 2021\nThen output ONLY the first name of his wife. Output a single word: the first name only, no punctuation or extras.\n\nHere are the document-level extractions:\n" + context_info + "\nAnswer with the wife's first name only.")
return_result(final_answer)